I'm like, I mean, I'm --

00:04:04.534 --> 00:04:06.367
So I went out
for "Breaking Bad."

00:04:06.367 --> 00:04:10.367
And in my memory, Aaron and I
were testing against one another

00:04:10.367 --> 00:04:11.701
