00:04:11.701 --> 00:04:13.567
And, you know, that's great.
Like, Aaron so --

00:04:13.567 --> 00:04:16.033
He killed that role.
Like, it was obviously his.

00:04:16.033 --> 00:04:19.133
And that year --
or the years prior,

00:04:19.133 --> 00:04:20.434
we'd been going out for things
together.

00:04:20.434 --> 00:04:22.000
-You went out for the same role?
-Yeah.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.434
Like, you know, when you're
coming up in Hollywood,

00:04:24.434 --> 00:04:25.901
